     "text": "Power, Unleashed"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Lenovo Legion Towers are the pinnacle of engineering, balancing a refined chassis with customizable lighting and elite components. Featuring top-of-the-line processors and discrete graphics, these desktop powerhouses are built to deliver peak performance for gaming, streaming, and professional creation."
    },
    {
