  },
  {
   "section": "series-blade2",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Built to Keep You In-Game"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Upgrade to Legion Ultimate Support to stay in-game when it matters, with support from specialists who are gamers too. Skip the long wait and get straight to fixing what’s wrong. Remote or on-site, with parts replacement included, you’re covered whenever issues hit."
